{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "801b2b75867d8768c1e4697a8cb35154e4619e636548572fbd2cf0d9ce167809", "ja": "アピールポイント！", "zh": "魅力点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9c416aede7cb590d642506124899712a193d038e5ca883f3d746be632dad1a37", "ja": "公演に向け、取材と個別のインタビューを\n受ける事になった美也達。一幕から四幕まで\nの積み重ねを受け、注目されている事を\n実感する。そんな中、美也は観客の期待を\n煽るようなコメントを残す。", "zh": "为了演出，美也等人将接受采访和个人专访。随着从第一幕到第四幕一步步积累下来，她们切实感受到了自己正受到关注。在这期间，美也留下了一番吊起观众期待的评论。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "75e10e93ca6074859c06047d666ef36e579f79d3a688d7a0c901f4bafe8ae728", "ja": "（今日は『STARDOM ROAD』公演第五幕メンバーの\n取材と、個別インタビューがある）", "zh": "（今天要对《STARDOM ROAD》公演第五幕的成员进行采访，还有单独采访。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4c32f635a660b4c13496ab1a5718f9d1dc4b731ee005b97e8afa7b97a81eee2f", "ja": "インタビューは、自分が演じるキャラクターについて。\nあと、意気込みなんかも語ってほしいとの事だ。", "zh": "采访内容是关于自己所饰演的角色。\n另外，对方还希望我们谈谈干劲之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "121d9283bb00729bc6cb82e0512265f72b21806c96d8afde7eea7fc1c7670fc5", "ja": "個別インタビュー、やっぱうれしいですね！\n私ら、注目されてるんやな～。", "zh": "能接受单独采访，果然还是很开心呢！\n看来我们也受到关注了呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "292532c6e7e0a31689c0dc46df8f2c97587f2b62820224b8b85f668a859f3381", "ja": "これも、第四幕までのみんなが、\nメッチャがんばったからやんな？", "zh": "这也是因为大家一直努力到了第四幕吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f6edf5b6b79a5d04d3187ac887f469ce6c91cc950fb8e0ddf2ab61a1bdd00309", "ja": "うん、アタシもそう思う。みんなの積み重ねの結果、\nアタシ達が注目されてる、っていうか。", "zh": "嗯，我也这么觉得。可以说是因为大家积累的成果，\n我们才会受到关注吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ca9709c57136af5759a0edd41591f1b3d18f4dbd155b08bae05959ff635fe62a", "ja": "……あれ？　そう考えると、このインタビューって\nけっこう責任重大なんじゃ……！？", "zh": "……咦？这么一想，这次的采访\n责任岂不是相当重大吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "69723dc65d89bdf1f5bae1e00764760cae9c1a04b0eb4e7649fd536ffcfdde9b", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だ歩。総評みたいな事ではないし、\n一人当たりの時間は短めだから。", "zh": "没、没事的，步。这不是什么总结之类的，而且每个人的时间都比较短。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0b6d4369e5376ea874f705b2294837154e79575018231280168b2aaa590eeeed", "ja": "あくまで、自分が今回演じる事への感想でいい。\nアピールポイントは、主張してほしいけどな！", "zh": "总之，只要说说自己对这次出演的感想就行。不过，自己的亮点还是希望你能好好强调一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "035d2b9ad2890f2c222fd2ce66102a1d02be110e4ff2e9298c4db2384b8334ed", "ja": "アピールポイント……。\n杏奈、考えた……大丈夫……たぶん。", "zh": "亮点……  \n杏奈想过了……没问题……大概。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "47da5e23dcc82a6ec36f8cbfedc60a1b082f2980b9d341bfa0fce82ec593fcaf", "ja": "お～。杏奈ちゃん、事前準備とは流石ですな～。\nけど、アピールポイントですか～。む～ん。", "zh": "哦～杏奈亲，事先准备得很充分嘛～不愧是你呢～  \n不过，要说亮点吗～唔～嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e453ee488e94456b7e2b404451286e04430b2d9566f4a70fe5b720e12f12f505", "ja": "おっと。そろそろ取材の人が来る時間だな。\nみんな、会議室に移動しようか。", "zh": "哎呀，差不多到采访的人要来了。  \n大家去会议室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1011_interviewer", "source_sha256": "2e6c5f30edfb2d2824a00221d607d312bd077f107f18b0692bcf0b9a65acda69", "ja": "それでは、よろしくお願いいたします。\nまずは望月杏奈さんからですね。", "zh": "那么，就拜托您了。\n首先从望月杏奈开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1012_interviewer", "source_sha256": "51ea892fba610530d93f80cd6ed0ef507fc38f02b1f94819e795aa56ae2d47e9", "ja": "早速ですが、望月さんから見て\n一宮真珠星はどういった子ですか？", "zh": "先说一下，从望月小姐的角度来看，一宫真珠星是个怎样的孩子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "f7896e1462a700817c847e89c3a7bd137c5ef5799811cb95af9b033454a7546f", "ja": "えと……真珠星、は……。アイドルに、\nどんどん……真剣になっていって……ます。", "zh": "呃……真珠星，她……正在变得越来越……认真对待偶像这件事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "ba5cc10de990b19898ba1672239a28df8403791958e9a0cd8a31387493da36eb", "ja": "杏奈も……アイドルは、真剣……。\nそういうところ……似てる、かも……。", "zh": "杏奈也……对偶像这件事，很认真……。\n这一点……或许很像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1015_interviewer", "source_sha256": "a1a48051c4a2144fba7e35c78f47340fbd50ba8cb447ae191aafee8ddafd6ff6", "ja": "なるほど。アイドルへの姿勢に\n共感するところがあった、ということですね！", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，您对她对待偶像的态度产生了共鸣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "1b93787fd09b8187c47780553b8ea4cd0caec37a14016723244a025eaa3500d2", "ja": "はい……！　えっと、それ、大事にして……\n本番も、演じたい……です……！", "zh": "是的……！那个……我很认同这点……\n正式演出时，我也想好好演绎……她……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1017_interviewer", "source_sha256": "c99978491f7d4a8e74d9863f96faa4ee2e2dcd1d7c1021a163056372f53aadbc", "ja": "横山さんは、真珠星とペアを組む笹森藍役ですね。\n彼女を演じるうえで、気をつけたことなどは？", "zh": "横山小姐饰演的是与真珠星组成搭档的笹森藍，对吧。饰演她时，有什么特别注意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "31a2e15e94dbc2d4c44042fbaaa7662a338a748a8030fddaee185e4d07ead54a", "ja": "藍は、真珠星や他のみんなを見守るようなことが\n多いんで。そこは意識しました！", "zh": "藍经常要守护真珠星和大家嘛。\n这一点我有特别注意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "6a522b2a478b6b91eba60cc14f5fe14c5dc3102bdc45d70d0e31320057d2b372", "ja": "私、面倒見いいってよう言われるんです！\nこれはギャグやなくてホンマですよ？", "zh": "我经常被人说很会照顾人呢！\n这可不是在开玩笑，是真的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "230565857267e763bf54bb6f83e03e63c08a085216d0abca7c335ea6505d5b47", "ja": "あと、東京弁の台詞は、本番までにがんばりますから。\n心配せんといてくださいね！", "zh": "还有，东京方言的台词，正式开演前我会加把劲练好的。\n不用担心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1021_interviewer", "source_sha256": "8acb780dceae0372ce391599aed8c1ebc2019b58b7e7a0b9eb87a1d252f5f4b9", "ja": "暁クロエは最後に加入したメンバーという事もあり、\n掴むのが難しいキャラクターのように思えますが……？", "zh": "晓克洛伊作为最后加入的成员，\n感觉是个难以把握的角色……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fa59ee39cf0110b76b11d9f479e7696f7b8d516e47ed1c51934a9ed15697a3d3", "ja": "そうですね、最初は悩みました！\nこの子、どういう子なんだろう？って。", "zh": "是啊，一开始我也苦恼过！  \n我当时就在想，这孩子到底是个什么样的人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fd605b96ca3a560b7c5439e8d626efa0b20d9ce29a330c83c87bb66d35ad2bee", "ja": "でもダンスに真剣で、上に行きたくて……。\n案外、純粋なだけなのかも？って思ったんです。", "zh": "不过，她对舞蹈很认真，也想要更上一层楼……  \n我就觉得，说不定她只是意外地单纯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e97d093264a4f59bc60efdb4459f72d79d1d50f192608bc37f2c574cf5699dd2", "ja": "その事に気づいてからは、あまり悩みませんでした。\nクロエならではの魅力を表現できたらなって！", "zh": "意识到那件事之后，我就没怎么烦恼了。\n要是能展现出只有克洛伊才有的魅力就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8d1f553d8d88ef46066e29a0bb04525d327dda9d6562fd02009934606f11fce8", "ja": "（それぞれ、自分が演じるキャラを掴みつつあるな。\n最後は、主演の美也だけど……）", "zh": "（大家都已经逐渐掌握了自己要饰演的角色。最后就是主演美也了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1026_interviewer", "source_sha256": "ade59ae8427aaf19b1961b437f737a63914d9d1d1e6ec8ac42b6805f872829ef", "ja": "今回、初めて主演キャラクターが\n真珠星から三船なるになりますね。", "zh": "这次，主演角色首次从真珠星变成三船なる了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1027_interviewer", "source_sha256": "9c4be583bca2d1640be0e4c625f04f7de9f788cd0688c4366091d9fed5e6fa3d", "ja": "宮尾さんから見た、彼女の魅力とは？", "zh": "在宫尾眼里，她的魅力是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "ddbf42782d5cdf853a9e24a69b4807c17ca564affc374da606edde2e8b19b023", "ja": "そうですね～。今回は、なるが\n大きな悩みに直面するお話なんですが～。", "zh": "嗯～这次讲的是，成要面对一个很大的烦恼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "854fda4d7f8c24cde73e21a0d81add9f3f5ef74682062ef961abe5a48d42520d", "ja": "詳しく話すと、ネタバレになってしまいますし……\n私からは一言だけでいいですか～？", "zh": "说得太详细的话会剧透的……\n我只说一句话可以吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1030_interviewer", "source_sha256": "e670cc2f2e15254e0e5c41452ceff8761ed3dd48dc7e1dab3f71136a2a1a94c0", "ja": "ほう……！", "zh": "哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "0a82eb62e1c0f84609d7ab993cfb71bbb13d66ea9e96f621ce2f1f3ad2afd696", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』の主人公は真珠星ですが、\nそれを取り巻く人達もまた、主人公なんです～。", "zh": "《STARDOM ROAD》的主角虽然是真珠星，\n但围绕在她身边的人们，也同样是主角呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_02_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "2fcc8f177688220a13225ac9574516ec587e831ec5a57a3c681ffc33f8803a49", "ja": "舞台を観てもらえたら、必ず伝わると思います～。\nぜひ、みなさん、確かめに来てください～。", "zh": "只要大家来看这场舞台剧，一定就能明白了～。请大家一定要来亲自确认一下哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
